<title>UK: SEK adds 1.0 bln rand to 30-year zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>SEK adds 1.0 bln rand to 30-year zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Hambros Bank, has been increased to 3.0 billion rand from 2.0 billion rand.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    25.JUN.27</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  2.78	PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  0.10</p>
</text>
